          "kicker": "Form slump",
          "heading": "Fiji drop to 12th in standings after suffering defeat against Scotland",
          "body": "In their last five games, Fiji have won one match. They have lost four of those five matches. Their most recent fixture ended in a 20-15 home defeat against Japan in September 2026 during the knockout stage of the Pacific Nations Cup. In the current tournament, the team sit 12th in the standings after three matches. The side has suffered three losses from those three games, most recently falling 17-33 to Scotland."
