          "kicker": "Refereeing revamp",
          "heading": "Premiership agrees refereeing revamp to boost Steve Borthwick's World Cup plans",
          "body": "Steve Borthwick has secured a significant structural boost ahead of next year's World Cup in Australia. Premiership Rugby has agreed to a refereeing revamp for the upcoming domestic season to better align club officiating with the international game. Following a meeting between Borthwick and directors of rugby, the RFU's refereeing team will adjust interpretations around the offside line, the scrum's brake-foot law, and the breakdown, targeting areas of previous inconsistency."
