          "kicker": "Selection policy",
          "heading": "French Rugby Federation faces scrutiny over secret player workload management agreement",
          "body": "Debate continues to swirl around the disclosure of a secret agreement between the FFR and LNR regarding the management of 33 elite players. While intended to regulate playing time ahead of next year's World Cup, the late revelation of the list has caused consternation among fans and clubs alike. Concerns persist regarding how this rotation policy, which mandates specific rest periods and limits to annual Test appearances, will influence team selections during the upcoming Six Nations tournament."
