          "kicker": "Tournament Venue",
          "heading": "Italy Men’s Team Prepare To Face South Africa In Turin Stadium",
          "body": "Top-level international rugby returns to the Allianz Stadium this November as Italy prepare to host reigning world champions South Africa. This match serves as the Azzurri's first home fixture in the newly established Nations Championship. The event was officially presented at the stadium on Sunday, 20 September, highlighting the venue's role as a recurring host for high-profile tests. Gonzalo Quesada’s side will look to build on this momentum, having already contested away matches in Japan, New Zealand and Australia."
