          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Scotland winger Darcy Graham ruled out of upcoming November international series",
          "body": "Scotland and Edinburgh winger Darcy Graham will miss the upcoming Nations Championship matches against New Zealand, Australia, and Japan after suffering a ruptured bicep. Edinburgh head coach Sean Everitt confirmed the injury, sustained in a recent friendly, will sideline the 29-year-old for at least 12 weeks. Everitt noted the disappointment of the news, stating, \"That's not good news for us and not good news for him, especially with the autumn series coming up.\" Graham is currently Scotland's leading try-scorer."
