          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Wales Women's Seren Lockwood ruled out for upcoming USA Test fixture",
          "body": "Scrum-half Seren Lockwood has been ruled out of the Wales Women's second WXV Global Series match against the USA this Saturday. Lockwood sustained a head injury during the first half of the side's victory over South Africa and is currently following World Rugby’s return-to-play protocols. Head coach Sean Lynn confirmed that while her absence is a loss, it provides an opportunity for Lleucu George to return at fly-half, with Keira Bevan shifting to her usual position at nine."
