          "kicker": "Tbilisi win",
          "heading": "The Pumas hammer the Iberians in commanding Tbilisi display",
          "body": "The Pumas recorded an emphatic 64-21 victory over Spain's Iberians in Tbilisi after leading 40-14 at half-time. Left wing Tino Swanepoel delivered a standout performance by crossing five times as the side ran in 10 tries during the fixture. Clinton Swart added a try alongside five conversions, while further tries came from Wian van Niekerk, Gustav du Rand, Alfondso Isaacs and André Fouché to seal the win."
        },
