          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Les Kiss shifts Joseph-Aukuso Suaalii to wing for Springboks Test",
          "body": "Wallabies coach Les Kiss is set to move outside centre Joseph-Aukuso Suaalii to the wing for Sunday's Test against the Springboks in Perth. The switch would mark the first time since the 23-year-old crossed to rugby union that he starts a Test anywhere other than outside centre, with Hunter Paisami expected to start at inside centre and Len Ikitau returning to No 13. Kiss's decision is understood to leverage Suaalii's aerial ability against South Africa's contested kicking game, adding height to the Wallabies' back three."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Japan beat Fiji 20-15 to win Pacific Nations Cup",
