          "kicker": "Pacific triumph",
          "heading": "Japan Brave Blossoms Win Asahi Super Dry Pacific Nations Cup 2026",
          "body": "The Brave Blossoms secured their first Pacific Nations Cup title since 2019 by defeating holders Fiji 20-15 in a fiercely physical Test match at Prince Chichibu Memorial Stadium. Captain Naoto Saito described the victory as a great breakthrough to create history for a young team entering the World Rugby top 10 rankings. Mamoru Harada and Ben Gunter scored tries to overturn a half-time deficit in a hard-fought contest."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
